3	 *
4	 * The repair re-sends a "the user read this chat" report that never reached its
5	 * host — the desktop was closed, or the bus was dead, when the user cleared the
6	 * dot. Everything about it is a judgement call about evidence, and the two
7	 * defects it has had were both about eligibility rather than mechanics: one made
8	 * the branch unreachable in its own headline case, the other recorded a failed
9	 * attempt as a completed repair.
10	 *
11	 * Only the repair is exercised here. The surrounding dot reconciliation has its
12	 * own coverage and is deliberately left alone.
13	 */
